    "$p=1/16$, so the probabilities for $X=-1,0,1,2,4$ are $1/4,1/16,1/16,3/8,1/4$.",
    "$p=1/16$, so $P(X=1)=1/16$, $P(X=2)=3/8$ and $P(X=4)=1/4$."
  ],
